<section id="guarantees" class="py-24 md:py-32"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1360px] px-5 sm:px-6 md:px-8 xl:px-10 grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10"><div class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div><p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ember"><span class="size-1.5 rotate-45 bg-ember" aria-hidden="true"></span>Our promises</p><h2 class="mt-5 text-h2 font-semibold text-balance text-ink max-w-[12ch]">Promises we put in writing.</h2></div></div><p class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink/12 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate">License #GD-004417<!-- --> · <!-- -->Insured to $2M</p></div></div><ul class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-line bg-line sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-8"><li class="group flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 bg-card p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-paper sm:p-9"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-slate">01</span><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sand text-ink transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-ember group-hover:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span></div><div><h3 class="font-heading text-[1.5rem] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em]">Springs covered for life</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate">Should a spring we fitted ever break, the replacement part costs you nothing for as long as you own the home.</p></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 bg-card p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-paper sm:p-9"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-slate">02</span><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sand text-ink transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-ember group-hover:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg></span></div><div><h3 class="font-heading text-[1.5rem] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em]">Two years on our labor</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate">Every repair carries it. If our work fails, we come back and put it right at no charge.</p></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 bg-card p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-paper sm:p-9"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-slate">03</span><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sand text-ink transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-ember group-hover:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-receipt-text size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z"></path><path d="M14 8H8"></path><path d="M16 12H8"></path><path d="M13 16H8"></path></svg></span></div><div><h3 class="font-heading text-[1.5rem] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em]">A fixed price, in writing</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate">The price arrives on your phone before we start, and that is the price you pay.</p></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 bg-card p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-paper sm:p-9"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-slate">04</span><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sand text-ink transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-ember group-hover:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span></div><div><h3 class="font-heading text-[1.5rem] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em]">Our own background-checked team</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate">Every technician is on our payroll, in uniform and driving a marked truck. We never send subcontractors.</p></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 bg-card p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-paper sm:p-9"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-slate">05</span><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sand text-ink transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-ember group-hover:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-landmark size-5" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="22" y2="22"></line><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="18" y2="11"></line><line x1="10" x2="10" y1="18" y2="11"></line><line x1="14" x2="14" y1="18" y2="11"></line><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="18" y2="11"></line><polygon points="12 2 20 7 4 7"></polygon></svg></span></div><div><h3 class="font-heading text-[1.5rem] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em]">Licensed &amp; insured</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate">License #GD-004417, insured to $2 million.</p></div></li><li class="group flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 bg-card p-7 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-paper sm:p-9"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-slate">06</span><span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sand text-ink transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-ember group-hover:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brush size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9.06 11.9 8.07-8.06a2.85 2.85 0 1 1 4.03 4.03l-8.06 8.08"></path><path d="M7.07 14.94c-1.66 0-3 1.35-3 3.02 0 1.33-2.5 1.52-2 2.02 1.08 1.1 2.49 2.02 4 2.02 2.2 0 4-1.8 4-4.04a3.01 3.01 0 0 0-3-3.02z"></path></svg></span></div><div><h3 class="font-heading text-[1.5rem] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em]">We clean up after ourselves</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate">Old parts and old doors leave with us, and the floor gets swept before we go.</p></div></li></ul></div></section>
